### No token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products

### USER reads the catalogue -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### USER cannot change the catalogue -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Comet Snacks"}

### ADMIN changes the catalogue -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Comet Snacks"}

### Reports need the API key -> 200 (401 without it)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/top-products
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
